        "d5",
        "d6",
        "d7",
        "d8"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Product Details",
        "body": "<p>Experience professional-grade DTF printing made effortless with Fineyst Transfers. Every transfer is produced using our VIVID+ DTF process, featuring an expanded CMYK + RGBO + White ink system that delivers dramatically brighter colors, smoother gradients, and sharper detail - at no extra cost. From vibrant colors and clean whites to fine lines and complex gradients, our high-quality DTF transfers give shops, brands, and creators the freedom to print virtually any design on any garment with consistently standout results.</p>",
        "subheading": "Super Vivid Prints. No Upcharge.",
        "subbody": "<p>Most DTF providers still use 5-color printing as their standard. Accessing 9-color printing typically requires a paid upgrade, often increasing costs by up to 50%.</p><p>Fineyst includes 9-color VIVID+ printing on every DTF order at no additional cost.</p>"
      }
    },
